# 🤖 Production-Ready Mini RAG API with FastAPI & FAISS

A high-performance, persistent Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) backend built using **FastAPI**, **Sentence Transformers**, **FAISS**, and **Google Gemini API**. 

This system allows users to upload documents (PDF/TXT), automatically chunks and embeds them, stores vectors persistently on disk, and answers user queries with context-grounded AI responses.

---

## 🌟 Key Features

- 📄 **Multi-Format Document Parsing:** Upload PDF and TXT files directly via API endpoints using `pypdf`.
- ✂️ **Smart Text Chunking:** Implements `RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter` (500 chars, 50 overlap) for context-aware embeddings.
- ⚡ **Fast Vector Search:** Uses Facebook AI Similarity Search (**FAISS**) with 384-dimensional dense vectors (`all-MiniLM-L6-v2`).
- 💾 **Persistent Disk Storage:** Automatically syncs vector indexes and text chunks to disk (`faiss_index.bin` & `documents.pkl`), keeping data safe across server restarts.
- 🧠 **Context-Grounded LLM Responses:** Integrates Google's **Gemini 2.5 Flash** model (`google-genai` SDK) to prevent hallucinations and answer strictly based on retrieved context.
- 🚀 **Interactive Swagger API Docs:** Built with FastAPI for automated, interactive documentation and easy API testing.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Framework:** FastAPI, Uvicorn
- **Embedding Model:** SentenceTransformers (`all-MiniLM-L6-v2`)
- **Vector Database:** FAISS (Facebook AI Similarity Search)
- **LLM Integration:** Google Gemini API (`google-genai`)
- **Document Processing:** PyPDF, LangChain Text Splitters

---

